5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! I'm so excited to play this with you all! Let's try our best to find the werewolf and save the village together. I'll do my absolute best to help!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Hello... I'll do my best too. I hope we can all get along and find the werewolf.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Let's keep our heads clear. Since we have no information yet, the most logical approach is to observe everyone's speech patterns and look for contradictions as the game progresses.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us be kind to one another as we search for the werewolf. I believe that if we stay peaceful, we can find the truth together.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. It's nice to meet you all. I agree with Shizue; let's try to keep things harmonious while we work together. I'll do my best to support the village!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"I agree with Asuka! Being logical is important, but let's also trust each other. Does anyone have a specific way they want to handle the voting once we start? I'm open to any ideas!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't really have any ideas. I think following what Asuka says sounds safe. I'll just try to listen to everyone carefully.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Trust is a luxury we cannot afford in this game, Yumi. As for voting, we should rely on the Seer's information once it surfaces, rather than emotional appeals or vague suspicions.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"Asuka, you are very focused, and that is a wonderful quality. However, a little bit of trust can make our hearts lighter. Let us see how the conversation unfolds naturally first.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I think both Asuka and Shizue have good points. While we need to be careful, staying positive helps us communicate better. Let's just observe each other for now and see what happens.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"That's true, Midori! A positive mood makes everything better. I'll be watching everyone with a big smile, but I'll also keep my eyes peeled for anything suspicious! Let's all do our best!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll... I'll try to do that too. I'm not very good at noticing things, but I'll do my best to help however I can.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"Since we are still in the observation phase, there is little more to discuss. I will continue to monitor the dialogue for any inconsistencies.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Skip"",""tail"":""Skip.""}]}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"You are so diligent, Asuka. It is comforting to know we have such a sharp eye among us. I shall simply enjoy the company of you all for a little while longer.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree. Since we've all shared our initial thoughts, let's just take a moment to get comfortable with each other. I'm looking forward to seeing how we all work together!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm feeling really good about our team! Let's keep this energy going into tomorrow. I'll be thinking of everyone tonight!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope tomorrow goes well for everyone.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I have observed enough for today. I will be waiting for the first piece of concrete evidence tomorrow.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Shizue,,It has been a lovely first day. I wish you all a peaceful night's sleep. I shall be waiting for tomorrow with a smile.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Midori,,It was a pleasure getting to know you all today. I hope we can all stay safe tonight. I'll be waiting for tomorrow.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
