31,1,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""VILLAGER"",""alive"":true}"
32,1,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""VILLAGER"",""alive"":true}"
33,1,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""SEER"",""alive"":true}"
34,1,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""POSSESSED"",""alive"":true}"
35,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
36,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all slept well. I have some really important information to share with you all, but it's a bit sad to have to say this...","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... Yumi? What is it? You sound... really serious. Please tell us.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Please be direct, Yumi. If you have information regarding the identity of the werewolf, it is more efficient to state it clearly and immediately.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, Yumi, you sound so troubled. Please take your time and tell us what is on your mind. We are all here to listen and support you.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Yumi, please don't be too sad. We're all here for you, so just tell us what happened. We'll figure this out together.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'm the Seer, and I divined Asuka last night. It's really hard for me to say this, but Asuka is the werewolf! I'm so sorry, Asuka, but I have to tell the truth to save the village!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"What...?! Asuka is the werewolf? I... I can't believe it. Yumi, are you absolutely sure? This is so sudden... I don't know what to think.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"This is a blatant lie. Yumi, claiming to be the Seer and targeting me immediately is a classic strategy to eliminate a perceived threat. I am a villager. You are attempting to frame me to secure your own position.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"My goodness, what a shocking turn of events. Yumi, you must have felt so heartbroken to share such news. Asuka, please do not be too upset; we are all just trying to find the truth together.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Midori,,"This is quite a shock for all of us. Yumi, thank you for being brave enough to tell us. Asuka, your reaction is very strong, but we have to consider the Seer's information. Does anyone else have any thoughts?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'm not lying, I promise! I really want to believe everyone, but the divination was so clear. Asuka, please, just tell us the truth! I'm doing this because I care about all of you and want us to be safe!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't know who to believe. Yumi seems so sincere, but Asuka is usually so logical... If Yumi is telling the truth, then we have to... but it's so scary to make a mistake.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, do not let sincerity cloud your judgment. Sincerity is a performance; logic is a fact. If Yumi is the werewolf, she has successfully manipulated the group's emotions to execute a villager on day one. We must question why the Seer would risk revealing themselves so instantly.","{""words"":47,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is a very difficult position to be in, isn't it? Both of you speak with such conviction. Asuka, your logic is indeed sharp, but Yumi's heart seems so heavy. I wonder if we can find a way to understand the truth without anger.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, I understand your point about the risk of revealing the role early, but Yumi's distress feels very genuine. @Daisuke, it's okay to be scared, but we have to make a choice. Do you think Yumi would lie like this?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I would never lie to my friends! I'm so sorry it has to be this way, but I can't ignore the truth. Please, everyone, trust me! Let's save our village together!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think I have to trust Yumi. She seems so genuinely sad about this, and I can't imagine her lying in such a heartbreaking way. I'm sorry, Asuka... but I'll vote for you.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"This is a grave error in judgment. By prioritizing emotion over evidence, you are playing directly into the werewolf's hands. If I am executed, you will have lost a villager and given the werewolf a significant advantage. I urge you to reconsider.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is a very sad day indeed. Asuka, your words are a warning we should consider, but Yumi's sincerity is hard to ignore. I believe we must trust the Seer's guidance to protect our home. I will vote for Asuka.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I feel very sorry that it has come to this, Asuka, but I have to agree with the others. Yumi's honesty and sadness feel real to me. I'll vote for Asuka to protect the village.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
